<title>USA: Chicago $500 mln school bonds repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>Chicago $500 mln school bonds repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co. said Wednesday repriced Chicago's $500 million School Reform Board of Trustees bond deal, lowering yields in several maturities but raising the top yield in 2027 to 6.05 percent from 6.03 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
